# Whitelist: only this project's own sources and notes are tracked. Game data, keys, dumps, extracted or rewritten game
# code, generated tables (they hold game symbols), build outputs and the cloned reference projects never are.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/BUILDING.md
!/LICENSE
!/LICENSES/
!/NOTICE
!/port/
!/patches/

# inside port/: outputs and fetched sources
/port/rewriter/out-*/
/port/rewriter/verify-*/
/port/rewriter/merged*.py
/port/rewriter/android_patch_nso.py
/port/rewriter/patch_nso.py
/port/xlate/work-*/
/port/xlate/linux-*/
/port/xlate/ndk-bin/
/port/xlate/*.log
/port/android/deps/src/
/port/android/deps/build/
/port/android/deps/out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.o
*.so
*.apk
*.log
